{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[heart-burn]]

===Etymology===
From {{compound|heart|burn}}, translating Ancient Greek {{term|καρδιαλγία|lang=grc}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|-}}

# {{pathology}} A burning pain in the chest that is caused by stomach acid entering the [[gullet]].

====Synonyms====
* [[acid reflux]]
* [[cardialgia]]
* [[gastroesophageal reflux]]
* [[pyrosis]]

